Feature: Wallet payments # features/wallet.feature:1

  Feature: Wallet payments  # features/wallet.feature:1

  @smoke
  Scenario: Spend money when balance is enough  # features/wallet.feature:7
    Given a wallet with balance 100             # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:6
    When I spend 30                             # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:11
    Then the payment is accepted                # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:27
    And the balance is 70                       # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:37

  Scenario: Not enough money        # features/wallet.feature:12
    Given a wallet with balance 100 # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:6
    When I spend 500                # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:11
    Then the payment is declined    # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:32
    And the balance is 100          # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:37

  Scenario: Add money               # features/wallet.feature:17
    Given a wallet with balance 100 # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:6
    When I add 50                   # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:16
    Then the balance is 150         # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:37

  Scenario: Several payments in a row   # features/wallet.feature:21
    Given a wallet with balance 100     # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:6
    When I make the following payments: # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:21
      | amount |
      | 10     |
      | 20     |
    Then the balance is 70              # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:37

  Scenario Outline: Payments with different amounts -- @1.1   # features/wallet.feature:35
    Given a wallet with balance 100                           # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:6
    When I spend 1                                            # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:11
    Then the payment is accepted                              # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:27
    And the balance is 99                                     # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:37

  Scenario Outline: Payments with different amounts -- @1.2   # features/wallet.feature:36
    Given a wallet with balance 100                           # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:6
    When I spend 100                                          # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:11
    Then the payment is accepted                              # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:27
    And the balance is 0                                      # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:37

  Scenario Outline: Payments with different amounts -- @1.3   # features/wallet.feature:37
    Given a wallet with balance 100                           # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:6
    When I spend 101                                          # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:11
    Then the payment is declined                              # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:32
    And the balance is 100                                    # features/steps/wallet_steps.py:37

